# (AI-assisted) tie-heavy views for the tie levels of detail (c3l v17): village1, the village3 warp
# gate, the snowy fort, jungle, beach. Each view: the checkpoint, ~6 s to settle, then a "view"
# window of 120 frames (the [softstats] / [ctr] tie levels of detail lines in it) and a named shot.
# Host: CTR_SOFT_STATS=60 gk --ctr-gfx --ctr-dump DIR ...; PC reference: gk without --ctr-gfx.
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
10 continue village1-hut
11 wait *target* target-continue
12 wait *target* target-stance
200 log view-begin village1
320 shot tie_village1
321 log view-end village1
330 continue village3-warp
331 wait *target* target-continue
332 wait *target* target-stance
520 log view-begin village3-warp
640 shot tie_village3_warp
641 log view-end village3-warp
650 continue snow-fort
651 wait *target* target-continue
652 wait *target* target-stance
840 log view-begin snow-fort
960 shot tie_snow_fort
961 log view-end snow-fort
970 continue jungle-tower
971 wait *target* target-continue
972 wait *target* target-stance
1160 log view-begin jungle
1280 shot tie_jungle
1281 log view-end jungle
1290 continue beach-start
1291 wait *target* target-continue
1292 wait *target* target-stance
1480 log view-begin beach
1600 shot tie_beach
1601 log view-end beach
1610 exit
